        </div>

        <div class="mt-4 border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-white/40">Integration target</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] text-white/75">Existing Persuratan FMIPA system and its academic data environment</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="site-container py-10 md:py-16" data-reveal>
  <div class="editorial-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="mono-label text-muted">Data Sources</p>
    </div>

    <div class="editorial-content grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5">
      <article class="border border-line p-5">
        <code class="font-mono text-[10px]">api_khs_raw</code>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.65] text-muted">KHS and course-history records used to evaluate completed academic activity and derive further monitoring data.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="border border-line p-5">
        <code class="font-mono text-[10px]">api_bimbingan_raw</code>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.65] text-muted">Relationship between student NIM and supervisor NIP.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="border border-line p-5">
        <code class="font-mono text-[10px]">pegawais</code>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.65] text-muted">FMIPA employee data used to resolve supervisor information.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="border border-line p-5">
        <code class="font-mono text-[10px]">users</code>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[12px] leading-[1.65] text-muted">Persuratan user accounts used as part of access and user-data handling.</p>
      </article>

